N 來了 = N came / arrived
蕎麥麵 = buckwheat noodles

1625
01:48:05,109 --> 01:48:07,613
那我就不客氣了。

1626
01:48:07,636 --> 01:48:10,016
聽力測驗

1627
01:48:10,016 --> 01:48:12,721
真好吃！

1628
01:48:12,721 --> 01:48:16,493
好吃 (delicious) ↔ 難吃 (unpalatable / bad tasting)

1629
